# Browsers the build targets: @angular/build turns these queries into esbuild targets for JS and CSS.
# They follow Angular 21's browser support policy, "baseline widely available" on the date in
# node_modules/@angular/build/src/utils/supported-browsers.js. The build warns about a browser outside
# that policy but still targets it, so raise these minimums together with Angular majors.
#
# To list the browsers these queries select: npx browserslist

Chrome >= 111
ChromeAndroid >= 111
Edge >= 111
Firefox >= 112
FirefoxAndroid >= 112
Safari >= 16.4
iOS >= 16.4
